    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1083-a4">

                <pb facs="0990" n="676" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg676"/>


                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the Navy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Daniels</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Commanding Officer of the
                        Charleston Navy Yard</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Helm</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Navy Department</hi>, <lb/>
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 22, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Replying your telegram to-day, carry out President’s executive order regarding
                    radio communication and instructions for officers charged with enforcement same,
                    sealing radio apparatus of merchant vessels belligerent powers if necessary to
                    insure compliance.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Daniels</hi>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
